                                   <p class="faq-text">Morning breakfast at hotel – Excursion to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir( New ) nearly 40 kilometers - The Lake is oval shaped lake nearly 50 feet deep - Generally covered in snow for most of the year the year – This lake is home to the Brahmini ducks & many migratory birds – Nearby is the sacred Baba Mandir known to be a very holy site for all - Nathu La Pass to Republic of China is nearly 20 kilometers and is optional tour - Back to Gangtok - Evening free to roam around M G Road (Mall) or local Shopping center - Over Night stay at Gangtok.<br><b>(Incase of Landslide or due to any other reasons if Tshangu Lake is closed then an alternate sightseeing will be provided)</b></p>

                                </div>
