                                  <div id="collapse-8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="collapse-item-8"
                                  data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                                <div class="accordion-body style2">
                                    <p class="faq-text">A drive of 120 kilometers 3 ½ - 4 hours through scenic road via Jorethang and along the River Teesta for a short stretch – Darjeeling - It is situated at an height of 2123 meters / 70001 feet - It is a land of breathtaking beauty, sloping tea gardens with spectacular views of the Mount Everest is the Queen of the hills – Darjeeling is home to many international Schools and few of the internationally famous site like Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, Padmaja Naidu Zoological Park, Darjeeling Himalayan Railway, etc – It is also home to the famous World Heritage train – The Darjeeling Himalayan Railway (DHR) - Check into hotel – Evening free - Over Night stay at Darjeeling</p>

                                
                            </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
